HST Office: read-only mode both ways, and the texts around it.

- sfx2 viewfrm.cxx (SfxViewFrame::ExecReload_Impl): "Edit Document" (.uno:EditDoc) on a document opened read only
  reloaded it read only again and only unlocked the UI, so the title kept "(chỉ đọc)", Ctrl+S asked for a new name
  and AutoSave stayed off. A switch to editing now opens a file that can be written for writing; a switch to reading
  opens it read only (its lock is released). The reloaded document keeps the session's AutoSave choice.
  When the switch to editing fails or is cancelled ("Hủy" for a file locked by another user), the document stays
  read only instead of an unlocked view of a file it cannot write.
- sfx2 sfxbasemodel.cxx (SfxBaseModel::getTitle): "(read-only)" means the document cannot be edited now; a file with
  the read-only attribute that the user switched to editing (Save asks for another name) no longer carries it.
- sfx2 Tệp tin > Thông tin (hstbackstage.ui, hstbackstagewindow.cxx): "Chuyển sang chỉ đọc" / "Chỉnh sửa tài liệu"
  runs .uno:EditDoc; hidden for a document without a file.
- sw, sc, sd vi messages.po: "Chỉ đọc" for the View tab's "Read-Only" button (.uno:ReadOnlyDoc, lit while the
  document is read only; its hst-ribbon-label is in hst-ribbon-v3-ui.patch).
- svx docrecovery.cxx (BrokenRecoveryDialog): asked after the user discarded the recovery, the default button is
  "Hủy" (Enter copies nothing into Documents); after a recovery with failed documents "Lưu" stays the default.
- fpicker VistaFilePickerImpl.cxx: the Windows Open, Save As and folder dialogs get their title, OK button and
  file name label in the office's UI language (they followed the language of Windows). Cancel, "Save as type:" and
  the navigation pane have no interface and stay as Windows draws them.
- sfx2 test_hstautosave.cxx: edit mode both ways on a file opened read only, the AutoSave choice across a switch,
  and a file with the read-only attribute.

License: the upstream files remain under their original license (MPL-2.0); the HST files keep
LicenseRef-HST-Proprietary.
Test: make CppunitTest_sfx2_hst_autosave; tests/unit/test_read_only_toggle_patch.py.
